      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{637283d99bf1a03c74a71501|full_name} For the one instance I can remember, It was a moderately-sized `Friends+` instance (around 20 people) when it happened.\n\nWorld: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_8d7d7a84-5eea-4d85-a256-8d9cdb431ad6\n\nChecked to make sure I still had a log of the event and sadly I do not.\n\nit definitely wasn't a local \"just me\" issue as another person also observed it as well during that time.",
